Package: cohortprism
Type: Package
Title: Spectral Patient Prisms for Clinical Cohorts
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Each patient is a vertical multi-band prism stacking continuous molecular signatures, discrete mutation ticks, and a temporal clinical-event lane.
    Part of the bioviz suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
